<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#393939;"><p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em"> </p>
<div>Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</div>
<div> </div>
<div><!--StartFragment-->
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">I wanted to follow up on my previous message and see if you had a chance to explore the benefits of partnering with <strong>Zig-Zag Wholesale</strong>.</span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">With over <strong>140 years of heritage</strong> in rolling papers and a full line of <strong>smoking accessories</strong>, Zig-Zag remains one of the <strong>most recognized and trusted brands</strong> in the industry — and we'd love to support your business with direct access, competitive pricing, and promotional resources.</span></div>
<hr style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"/>
<h3 style='color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:"Segoe UI", "Segoe UI Web (West European)", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-style:normal; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0; line-height:1.3; margin:0; margin-bottom:12px; text-align:left; background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)'><span style="font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: inherit;">Quick Recap of Wholesale Benefits:</span></h3>
<ul data-end="1099" data-start="774" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;">
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>No MOQ</strong> (Order only what you need)</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>Free Shipping</strong> on orders $150+</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>Dedicated Account Rep</strong> for personalized service</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>POS Displays &amp; Materials</strong> available upon request</p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0"><strong>Exclusive Monthly Deals &amp; Promotions</strong></p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0">Access to <strong>The Original Rolling Papers</strong> — <em>Burning Slow Since 1879</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;"/>
